      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "The well-related ANARITA (5) (full to G2 winner Kristilli) just missed the placings two runs back then didn't feature last start when 4.5 lengths away in seventh over 1350m at Doomben. This is a much easier assignment and has the ability to find the winners' list. SCRUFFY (9) has been in the money at her last couple of runs, the latest when second over 1400m at Gatton. Hoop Brandon Lerena stays on and shapes as one of the main contenders. LAMBERTINA (6) finished fourth two runs back then did well last start but just found a couple better over 1300m at Sunshine Coast, beaten only 1.75 lengths. This looks a good race for her and there is no reason why she cannot find winning ways. PUREZZA (3) improved last time out, finishing 0.6 lengths from the winner in third at the end of 1200m at Toowoomba. Looks well placed so expect another big run.",
